      heading: Quotations & Work Packages
      descriptionPoints: '<p data-start="1468" data-end="1590">Generate professional quotations with structured work packages in just a few minutes, even for complex construction sites.</p><ul data-start="1592" data-end="1739"><li data-start="1592" data-end="1624">Templates by type of project</li><li data-start="1625" data-end="1680">Detailed work packages with visible/invisible lines</li><li data-start="1681" data-end="1739">Supplier catalogue imports: Viessmann, Vaillant, Bosch</li></ul>'
    - logo: analytique
      heading: Site Tracking & Profitability
      descriptionPoints: <p data-start="1780" data-end="1875">Manage each construction site in real time and measure its profitability before it is too late.</p><ul data-start="1877" data-end="1989"><li data-start="1877" data-end="1923">Tasks and Gantt view by construction phase</li><li data-start="1924" data-end="1954">Alerts for budget overruns</li><li data-start="1955" data-end="1989">Profitability analysis by site</li></ul>
    - logo: material-icon
      heading: Planning & Subcontractor Management
      descriptionPoints: <p data-start="2036" data-end="2144">Plan your teams and subcontractors, track their interventions, and validate their invoices in a single tool.</p><ul data-start="2146" data-end="2287"><li data-start="2146" data-end="2203">Intervention calendar by technician and subcontractor</li><li data-start="2204" data-end="2255">Purchase orders linked to the construction site</li><li data-start="2256" data-end="2287">Incoming invoice validation</li></ul>
    - logo: boucle
      heading: Periodic Maintenance & Subscriptions
      descriptionPoints: <p data-start="2335" data-end="2432">Manage recurring maintenance contracts and their automatic billing, from subscription to invoice.</p><ul data-start="2434" data-end="2562"><li data-start="2434" data-end="2467">Automatic contract generation</li><li data-start="2468" data-end="2506">Planning of periodic interventions</li><li data-start="2507" data-end="2562">Recurring billing + automatic customer confirmation</li></ul>
    - logo: conseiller-financier
      heading: Billing, Field Payments & PEPPOL
      descriptionPoints: '<p data-start="2606" data-end="2707">Bill based on progress, collect payments on site, and remain compliant with Belgian 2026 obligations.</p><ul data-start="2709" data-end="2849"><li data-start="2709" data-end="2754">Billing based on percentage of completion</li><li data-start="2755" data-end="2808">Field payment without POS module: Stripe terminal</li><li data-start="2809" data-end="2849">Native integrated PEPPOL e-invoicing</li></ul>'
